    "msg_dontwait",
    "nonblocking",
    "block_on",
    "eagain",
    "recv flags",
    "per-call flag"
  ],
  "contract": "recv(2): MSG_DONTWAIT makes that call nonblocking, so with no data it fails with EAGAIN even when the socket itself is blocking.",
  "observed": "By source reading at the pin (not run): recv(MSG_DONTWAIT) on an idle blocking TCP socket waits for data instead of returning EAGAIN.",
